      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاقِئٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوقِئٌ</span> The <i>posterior,</i> or, as some say,
<i>anterior, part</i> of the eye: (K:) or the <i>inner
angle</i> of the eye, <i>next the nose.</i> (K, &amp;c., art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مأق</span>.) Mentioned by most of the lexicographers
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مأق</span>, q. v. (TA.)

